h2 Viewing people

table.table
  thead
    tr
      th[scope="col"] ID
      th[scope="col"] Name
      th[scope="col"] Phone number
      th[scope="col"] Email address
      th[scope="col"] Company
  tbody
    - @people.each do |person|
      tr
        th[scope="row"]= person&.id
        td= person.try(:name)
        td= person.try(:phone)
        td= person.try(:email)
        td
          ul.m-0
            - person.companies.each do |company|
              li= company.name
